  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📖 關於&nbsp;📖</strong></span></h2><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>靈感來自<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"> <a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\">JUST ENOUGH EFFECT DESCRIPTIONS (JEED)</a></span></strong></h4><h4><br>適量效果描述 (MEED) 是一款 JEED/EMIffect 的附加組件，為多種不同的模組提供支援！你將能夠發現並了解 95 個以上模組的 500 多種狀態效果，而且數量還在持續增加中！</h4><h6>&nbsp;</h6><h4>就像 JEED 一樣，你可以在 JEI、REI 或 EMI 中查看狀態效果的相關資訊，例如其描述、來自哪個模組、效果顏色，以及哪些物品會施加/引發該效果！</h4><h6>&nbsp;</h6><h4>這個模組會持續新增對新模組的支援，並會盡快更新至最受歡迎的 Minecraft 版本！</h4><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/790/503/638409486810559684.png\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"800\" height=\"414\"></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>目前支援的模組：</strong></span></h4><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>必要模組：</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h5>選擇其中一個：</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEED<br></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emiffect-status-effects-emi-plugin\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMIffect</a></span></p>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\">選擇其中一個：</span></h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></p>\n<h5>For Fabric 模組：</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>可選支援模組：</strong></span></h4>\n<h4><strong>A-C</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (天境：再臨)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (深邃天境)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">亞歷克的洞穴</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alshanexs-familiars\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alshanex's 的使魔</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">新星藝術</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (新星擴展)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (元素藝術)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-bakery\" rel=\"nofollow\">烘焙坊 (舊版)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的終界 (Fabric)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\">生化術</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-makeover-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">生態域改造</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-and-madness\" rel=\"nofollow\">鮮血與瘋狂</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\">血魔法</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood-rebirth\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (血之書：重生)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">蔚藍天空</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">混沌降生</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bossesrise\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses'Rise</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brewery-farm-charm-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">釀造坊 (農場與魅力相容)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-brewery\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (舊版：釀造坊)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cas-extra-potions\" rel=\"nofollow\">CAS 的額外藥水</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/casualness-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">悠閒樂事</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caupona\" rel=\"nofollow\">湯品</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cofh-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoFH 核心</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cold-sweat\" rel=\"nofollow\">冷汗</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corail-tombstone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corail 的墓碑</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-bitterballen\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力：可樂球</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic\" rel=\"nofollow\">循環</a></p>\n</div>\n<h4><strong>D-L</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dark-waters\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑暗水域</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dave 的藥水學</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">更深更暗</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-blood\" rel=\"nofollow\">深淵之血</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/divine-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">神聖武器 - 更好的戰鬥</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">終界樂事</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoology\" rel=\"nofollow\">終界動物學</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enigmatic-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">謎之遺產</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightend\" rel=\"nofollow\">啟明</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩戰鬥</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">史詩騎士</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/evilcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">邪惡工藝</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/feathers\" rel=\"nofollow\">羽毛</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/festive-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">節日樂事</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/feywild\" rel=\"nofollow\">妖精荒野</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fungal-infection-spore\" rel=\"nofollow\">真菌感染：孢子</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gag\" rel=\"nofollow\">抗肝小工具</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galosphere\" rel=\"nofollow\">星系</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/habitat\" rel=\"nofollow\">棲息地</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hearth-and-harvest\" rel=\"nofollow\">爐火與豐收</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-herbal-brews\" rel=\"nofollow\">草本釀造</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illage-and-spillage-finally-ported\" rel=\"nofollow\">掠奪與溢出：再度掠奪</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jadens-nether-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jaden 的地獄擴展</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender 的災變</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legendary-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳說怪物</a></p>\n</div>\n<h4><strong>M-S</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mahou-tsukai\" rel=\"nofollow\">魔法使</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mariums-soulslike-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Marium 的魂系武器</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" rel=\"nofollow\">單一銀行</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\">突變怪物</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/my-nethers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的地獄樂事</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystic-potions\" rel=\"nofollow\">神祕藥水</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-aura\" rel=\"nofollow\">自然靈氣</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄異國風情</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄大修</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nutritional-balance\" rel=\"nofollow\">營養均衡</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/occultism\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘學</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasmic\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻象 (又名 Netherific)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potionsmaster\" rel=\"nofollow\">藥水大師</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/projectile-damage-attribute\" rel=\"nofollow\">投射物傷害屬性</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">夸克</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">遺物</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roundabout-the-jojo-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">迴轉：JOJO 模組</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sculk-horde\" rel=\"nofollow\">伏守者群落</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sculky-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">伏守碎片</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seasonals\" rel=\"nofollow\">季節性</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords/\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡單劍</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sons-of-sins\" rel=\"nofollow\">罪孽之子</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mobs-of-sins-alexs-mobs-integration-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (罪孽生物)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\">堅毅地牢</a></p>\n</div>\n<h4><strong>T-Z</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terramity\" rel=\"nofollow\">大地之力</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">工匠構造</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/too-many-bows\" rel=\"nofollow\">太多弓</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tough-as-nails\" rel=\"nofollow\">堅韌如釘</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trials-chambers-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">試煉密室 [1.20.1 回溯移植]</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unusual-prehistory-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">非凡史前</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/marvelous-menagerie\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (奇妙動物園)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\">吸血鬼</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/werewolves-become-a-beast\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (狼人 - 成為野獸！)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-degus\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版八齒鼠</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">葡萄園</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-nethervinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">- (地獄葡萄園)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\">流浪袋</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wans-ancient-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wan 的遠古野獸</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero 的小地圖</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xtra-arrows\" rel=\"nofollow\">額外箭矢</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ydms-scorpions\" rel=\"nofollow\">YDM 的蠍子</a></p>\n</div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🧪 自訂化🧪</strong></h2><h4>這個模組當然沒有支援所有模組！如果你想要，你可以透過在語言檔案中新增/修改字串 \"effect.[mod_id].[effect_name].description\" 來輕鬆變更或新增效果描述。如果你能將你新增的描述留言給我，讓我能將它們加入模組中，我將非常感激！如需更詳細的自訂化教學，請參閱 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEED CurseForge 頁面</a>。</h4><h6>&nbsp;</h6><h4>歡迎在你的模組包中使用它！</h4><h6>&nbsp;</h6><h4>也歡迎在 Issues 或評論區留下任何問題、意見、錯誤/問題和模組請求！</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h6><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>加入社群！</strong></span></h6><p><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/VqjVR3V6ZR\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/VqjVR3V6ZR</a></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/VqjVR3V6ZR\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ffB1D9e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"164\" height=\"53\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fneoncranberries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"品牌資產\" width=\"490\" height=\"99\"></a>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2>",
